### ITS GOING TO BE SWEATY, SALTY, STEAMY & FUN!

The sad news is [Camp Afro Foli](/camp-afro-foli-drum-dance-retreat/) Dance and Drum Retreat has come and gone.............the good news is, it's back this December! Just when you think that's it for another year, we announce we are doing it all over again! So for now, Camp Afro Foli has a winter and summer treat for you all. And we are celebrating this summer retreat with some very big things!

## Dance and Drum Retreat -  Camp Afro Foli

We now have three international artists coming for this big event. Solo Keita and Babara Bangoura, both from Guinea, will be joining us this summer, this is their first time in Australia and we feel very blessed to have them with us to share Guinean music and culture. We also have Clair Okamoto from Japan sharing her Guinean dance and shining her beautiful smile at Camp Afro Foli Dance and Drum Retreat. We can't wait to spend three days with these amazing and talented artists. We have moved the camp to Bribie Island with a new venue that is closer for those coming from the south and only 500 meters from the beach. It also has four person dorms all with ensuites, so a little bit of luxury too!! It takes a community to create something amazing and over the last two years we are so grateful for all the support everyone has given.  The drum and dance community that is growing through Camp Afro Foli is very special and we look forward to seeing you all there this summer!! It's going to be sweaty, salty and fun!! :) All the new [Camp Afro Foli Dance and Drum Retreat](/camp-afro-foli-drum-dance-retreat/) information can be found on our website. We have also just released a [video](https://youtu.be/NNmTMrm8y5s) from the last camp...... if you came along in July, spot yourself! If you didn't make it, get a taster for what's in store for December! Yay!! Find your Rhythm! Bec & Nat :)
